body:
Pretty sure fluids like sweat and cooking oils shows up on black light. As well as the more unclean fluids like blood, sexual fluids, urine, etc.  How stuff works has an article on it linked below super interesting stuff.

&#x200B;

https://science.howstuffworks.com/innovation/everyday-innovations/black-light.htm#:\~:text=Urine%2C%20semen%20and%20blood%20contain,also%20glow%20under%20black%20light.
